s on PocketFinds. Violations may result in immediate account suspension and may be reported to relevant authorities.\n\n4. Reviews & Ratings\nReviews must be honest and based on real transactions. Fake reviews, review manipulation, or incentivized reviews are strictly prohibited and will result in removal of the review and possible account action.\n\n5. Account Changes\nPocketFinds reserves the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes are posted means you accept the updated terms. You will be notified of major changes via email.\n\n6. Logistics Handling & Confidentiality\nHandle every parcel and its contents with care, keep buyer and seller information confidential, and record every pickup, sort, and assignment accurately in the system.',NULL,'2026-09-05 12:58:51','2026-09-05 12:58:51',NULL,'logistics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `policies` ENABLE KEYS */;
